WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:01.376
Those are craters.

2
00:00:01.376 --> 00:00:02.044
I can't.

3
00:00:02.044 --> 00:00:03.795
It's a ball.

4
00:00:03.795 --> 00:00:04.963
That is insane.

5
00:00:04.963 --> 00:00:06.256
Oh my God.

6
00:00:06.340 --> 00:00:07.966
It's something that's so far away

7
00:00:07.966 --> 00:00:09.134
and seems unattainable.

8
00:00:09.176 --> 00:00:12.512
Something I could almost, like, touch

9
00:00:12.512 --> 00:00:13.639
is insane.

10
00:00:13.847 --> 00:00:15.432
I don't think there's words

11
00:00:15.432 --> 00:00:18.602
that really give that feeling...

12
00:00:18.685 --> 00:00:20.687
I don't think anyone... very many people never get

13
00:00:20.687 --> 00:00:23.190
the experience of seeing it this close

14
00:00:23.190 --> 00:00:24.191
and that clear.

15
00:00:24.274 --> 00:00:25.692
Not to rain on your guys' parade,

16
00:00:25.692 --> 00:00:26.276
but I don't get

17
00:00:26.276 --> 00:00:27.027
what fascinates you guys

18
00:00:27.027 --> 00:00:28.195
so much about this.

19
00:00:28.862 --> 00:00:31.615
I have never looked at a telescope and seen anything.

20
00:00:31.615 --> 00:00:33.450
But seeing that...

21
00:00:33.450 --> 00:00:35.619
I get it.

22
00:00:35.827 --> 00:00:38.872
It always... stops in your tracks in a way.

23
00:00:39.039 --> 00:00:42.125
I think every moment I've been here, I've just been grinning.

24
00:00:42.334 --> 00:00:43.669
Because that's how it makes me feel.

25
00:00:43.752 --> 00:00:45.963
It's just been a grin on my face.

26
00:00:46.171 --> 00:00:49.466
That's one of the coolest things I've ever seen in my entire life.
